r [issue #2111](https://github.com/ispc/ispc/issues/2111) and is based on patched version of LLVM 12.0.1.\r\n\r\nThe bug fix affects x86 targets only and shows up as incorrect code generation for the sequence of `shuffle()` and `reduce_add()` stdlib functions.\r\n\r\nIf you are building `ispc` from the sources, note that the fix is implemented as a patch for LLVM backend and LLVM must be built with this patch applied in order for this fix to take an effect. Stock build of LLVM 12.0.1 will not contain this bug fix.","discussion_url":"https://github.com/ispc/ispc/discussions/2125","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ispc/ispc/releases/46289673/reactions","total_count":11,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":3,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":2,"eyes":0}}